  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Tom. This is my family. Grandma is here. She is my grandmother. She has a red hat. It is on her head. Grandma smiles.",
      "Grandpa is here too. He is next to Grandma. He has a blue shirt. His shirt is old. \"Is it a good shirt?\" \"Yes, it is!\" says Grandpa.",
      "I have two legs. Grandpa has two legs. How many legs? Grandpa and I have four legs! Grandpa and I walk. We are happy. \"I love my family,\" I say."
    ],
